<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings higher in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings higher in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended December 7, roastings totaled approximately 495,000 60-kg bags, up from 400,000 bags the previous week and compared with 475,000 bags in the corresponding week one year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 16,560,000 bags, versus 15,980,000 in the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
